# Loop 200 Review — Agent 1/10 (sidebar ↔ main spacing)

Branch: feature/loop-200-review

## Loop 1
- **Review:** CDP — sidebar right=240, main left=240, but padding-left=32px → content at 272px. Dead zone feels disconnected.
- **Fix:** `--main-pad-x: 16px`; `.app-main` padding uses tokens (32→16px).

## Loop 2
- **Review:** Flex + fixed sidebar (bloomberg) vs sticky `.sb` (layout) — dual layout paradigms.
- **Fix:** `.app.app-layout` CSS grid `240px 1fr`, gap 0; main `margin-left: 0 !important`.

## Loop 3
- **Review:** Ticker tape `left: 220px` vs `--sidebar-width: 240px` — 20px misalignment.
- **Fix:** Ticker default `left: var(--sidebar-width, 240px)`.

## Loop 4
- **Review:** `.sidebar.collapsed ~ .ticker-tape-wrap` never matches — ticker is sibling of `.app-layout`, not sidebar.
- **Fix:** `.app-layout:has(.sidebar.collapsed) ~ .ticker-tape-wrap`.

## Loop 5
- **Review:** `.app-main::before` full-viewport gradient starts at left:0, visually widening gutter.
- **Fix:** `left: var(--sidebar-width)`; collapsed variant via `:has()`.

## Loop 6
- **Review:** Hero card padding 38/40/32 adds perceived distance from nav column.
- **Fix:** Hero padding `32px 24px 28px`.

## Loop 7
- **Review:** Mobile — tape/background still offset by sidebar width when sidebar is off-canvas.
- **Fix:** `@media (max-width:768px)` tape + `::before` `left: 0`.

## Loop 8
- **Review:** Collapsed sidebar ticker used `--sidebar-collapsed: 56px` vs bloomberg 64px.
- **Fix:** Unified to 64px.

## Loop 9
- **Review:** Grid collapse had no transition — main jump felt abrupt.
- **Fix:** `transition: grid-template-columns` on `.app.app-layout`.

## Loop 10
- **Visual:** Collapsed CDP — grid `64px 1850px`, tape left=64px, main left=64px. OK.

## Loop 11
- **Review:** `.grid-2-1` gap 20px slightly loose on dashboard two-column blocks.
- **Fix:** gap 16px.

## Loop 12
- **Review:** `.sb` hard width 240px fought grid when collapsed.
- **Fix:** `.sidebar.collapsed.sb { width: 100% }`.

## Loop 13
- **Review:** base.html shell undocumented for grid column assignment.
- **Fix:** HTML comments on app-layout / sidebar column.

## Loop 14
- **Review:** `.main` padding shorthand conflicted with `.app-main` ticker padding.
- **Fix:** Padding only on `.app-main` via ui-enhance tokens.

